OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry with bright or sunny
OL,6,Fspells and light winds, clouding over
OL,7,Fin the afternoon especially for
OL,8,FPerthshire with the chance of the odd
OL,9,Fafternoon shower.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy over during the
OL,12,Fevening with a few showers in the
OL,13,Fwest, perhaps some clear spells
OL,14,Ftowards the Angus coast, heavier rain
OL,15,Fpossible by dawn.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain,
OL,18,Fbest of any bright weather for Angus
OL,19,Fin the morning, a few heavier showers
OL,20,Fin the afternoon, feeling cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
